 "noise_seed", "label": "noise_seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "noise_seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 129, "type": "RandomNoise", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RandomNoise"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax H3 七套服装连续换装｜直接使用\n\n1. **Picture 1：模特与场景图**。最终配套图已让模特穿上第一套衣服，构图按示例设置为头顶到裙摆/小腿附近，不露脚。它锁定人物、发型、身材、场景、构图和开场状态。\n2. **Picture 2–8：七套纯服装商品图**，没有其他模特或人脸，严格按希望出现的顺序连接。Picture 2 与 Picture 1 的开场服装相同，用于强化第一套衣服。\n3. 点击 Queue。默认生成 **15 秒、9:16、24fps**，并由 H3 自动生成无歌词时尚音乐和换装音效，不需要上传声音。\n4. 首次测试保持 0.4MP、20 steps、关闭 Lightning LoRA。确认人物和衣服顺序后，再提高分辨率。\n\n### 替换成自己的图片时\n- 模特必须是成年人，并拥有使用其肖像的授权。\n- 图1最好已经穿着图2的第一套衣服；如果做不到，也要保持正面、双手不遮挡躯干、背景干净。\n- 图2–8只放纯服装，使用白底、正面、完整、无遮挡商品图，不要出现其他人的脸、皮肤或身体。\n\n### 声音\n当前版本使用 **H3 原生自动音频**。若以后要严格踩你指定的歌曲，再增加 LoadAudio 并接到 ref_audios；先跑自动音频更容易把画面稳定下来。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明（先看这里）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 890], "pos": [-2030, 4840], "id": 116, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [292], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [290, 330], "pos": [-1050, 5960], "widgets_values": ["5c2b0851e21d3f8700e1dc7be7ade31116062d5e699a13ff982703f49cf3a556.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 137, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "Picture 1｜模特与场景", "properties": {"cnr_